--============================================================
-- V3 SAFE USAGE CONTRACT
--============================================================
-- This file preserves the original source rather than replacing it.
-- The cache scanner intentionally uses GetChildren() in a queue.
-- The queue is processed over multiple frames to reduce large single-frame spikes.
-- Added / Removing signals keep the index warm after the initial scan.
-- Player targeting remains separate from world-object indexing for speed.
-- The target resolver can switch between nearest, screen, low-health and smart scoring.
-- Sticky targeting avoids needless camera target churn.
-- Prediction is based on AssemblyLinearVelocity and is configurable.
-- ESP screen primitives are only updated at a capped interval.
-- 2D boxes use Model:GetBoundingBox() so the result adapts better to avatar size.
-- Skeleton rendering supports common R15 names and classic R6 names.
-- World ESP uses tag and attribute conventions so the experience can opt in cleanly.
-- The startup view doubles as scan progress feedback.
-- The existing black / white / red palette remains the main visual language.
